    "input": {
      "body": "Hi Cyrus,\n\nFollowing my note about client updates, I wanted to share a short article on a broader AI question: what needs to change beyond the software?\n\nMy take is that clear responsibilities and shared ways of working matter as much as the tool. Otherwise, a faster response can still leave the next step unclear. That's guiding our work at Possible Minds.\n\nhttps://getpossibleminds.com/t/9KtFw2bMyA\n\nFor your team, which seems harder: finding useful AI or changing established routines around it? I'd appreciate a quick take.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
      "subject": "Re: Nick J submitted a Google review about Law Offices of Cyrus Jamehdo",
